WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:10.480
If you knew the truth,

3
03:11.200 --> 03:13.280
you'd probably cry your eyes out.

4
03:13.880 --> 03:16.640
If you want to know, investigate it yourself.

5
03:16.720 --> 03:18.280
The way she threatened me just now…

6
03:18.360 --> 03:21.360
It sounded like there's some secret I don't know.

7
03:22.040 --> 03:23.640
You know why

8
03:23.720 --> 03:25.520
I agreed to claim Papang as my son.

9
03:26.120 --> 03:27.360
Just because I'm leaving…

10
03:27.440 --> 03:28.280
PREVIOUSLY

11
03:28.360 --> 03:31.520
…doesn't mean I'm giving up. I'll be back.

12
03:31.600 --> 03:35.040
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to do it.

13
03:35.120 --> 03:38.480
I'm the one who told Hathaya to bring her grandmother here.

14
03:47.280 --> 03:48.760
Is this okay for you, Grandma?

15
03:49.360 --> 03:53.400
At my age, it doesn't matter whether the room is big or small.

16
03:55.800 --> 03:59.200
As long as I have a roof over my head, that's enough.

17
03:59.840 --> 04:01.320
And as long as I get to be with you,

18
04:01.400 --> 04:04.760
I could even live under a bridge.

19
04:06.920 --> 04:10.000
This feels so good.

20
04:12.360 --> 04:14.160
Thank you, sweetheart.

21
04:14.240 --> 04:16.640
You've done everything for me.

22
04:16.720 --> 04:19.320
I should be the one thanking you.

23
04:19.399 --> 04:23.560
I grew up to be who I am because of everything you taught me.

24
04:27.840 --> 04:30.360
If Hathai had even a fraction of what you have,

25
04:31.040 --> 04:33.120
maybe our lives wouldn't have been so difficult.

26
04:35.880 --> 04:39.280
Grandma, have you heard anything from Mom?

27
04:39.880 --> 04:43.960
Not since I left the hospital. I haven't heard a thing from her.

28
04:46.960 --> 04:48.840
Don't talk about your mom anymore.

29
04:49.760 --> 04:51.680
We all have to bear with our own choices.

30
04:51.760 --> 04:53.640
Let's just love each other.

31
04:54.200 --> 04:55.080
That's right.

32
05:00.280 --> 05:02.560
How much longer are we going to live like this?

33
05:03.280 --> 05:05.040
We can't even go anywhere.

34
05:05.760 --> 05:08.240
If I'd known, I never would've opened that brothel with you.

35
05:08.320 --> 05:10.560
Did I force you to do it?

36
05:10.640 --> 05:13.680
You wanted money. You wanted to get rich the easy way. Stop complaining.

37
05:13.760 --> 05:17.920
Then what can we do? I can't live like this for another ten years.

38
05:18.000 --> 05:20.960
I'm asking someone powerful to pull strings for us.

39
05:24.400 --> 05:25.520
Yes, sir.

40
05:26.520 --> 05:30.040
All right, sir. I'll come see you right away.

41
05:30.120 --> 05:31.520
Yes, sir.

42
05:33.160 --> 05:36.680
He took care of everything. Bring the money.

43
05:37.280 --> 05:40.680
There's 200,000 baht left. I was going to save it to pay Mom back.

44
05:40.760 --> 05:42.920
What? You want to go to prison?

45
05:43.000 --> 05:44.000
-Give it to me. -Let go.

46
05:44.080 --> 05:45.600
Give it here.

47
05:45.680 --> 05:47.280
Go take a shower,

48
05:47.360 --> 05:49.240
and make yourself look nice.

49
05:49.320 --> 05:52.120
We're just returning his money. You can go by yourself.

50
05:52.200 --> 05:53.560
I'm not going. I'm staying here.

51
05:53.640 --> 05:58.240
Stop being difficult. If you want someone to help us, we both have to go.

52
05:58.840 --> 06:00.320
Are you coming or not?

53
06:00.400 --> 06:01.520
Fine.

54
06:01.600 --> 06:03.080
Go.

55
06:03.160 --> 06:04.480
Hurry up.

56
06:15.280 --> 06:18.160
He's waiting inside. Give him this money.

57
06:18.240 --> 06:20.480
He'll take care of everything.

58
06:23.840 --> 06:25.160
How is he going to do that?

59
06:25.240 --> 06:28.000
He'll find a scapegoat to take the blame for us.

60
06:28.080 --> 06:31.880
After that, we can go back to living comfortably.

61
06:31.960 --> 06:33.600
Come on. Go in.

62
06:34.640 --> 06:35.680
Where are you going?

63
06:36.280 --> 06:39.160
I'm going downstairs for a cigarette. I'll be back.

64
06:39.240 --> 06:40.480
Wait.

65
06:41.200 --> 06:43.600
You can smoke later. Come inside with me first.

66
06:47.920 --> 06:49.480
This is really all I have, sir.

67
06:51.520 --> 06:53.720
I'm not too concerned about the money.

68
06:55.240 --> 06:57.280
We help each other if we can.

69
06:57.360 --> 07:00.840
So this is all over now, right, sir?

70
07:01.440 --> 07:02.680
I settled it with the police.

71
07:02.760 --> 07:05.760
Thank you so much, sir.

72
07:07.320 --> 07:10.680
Then I won't take up any more of your time.

73
07:11.440 --> 07:12.960
I'll excuse myself.

74
07:13.480 --> 07:15.080
Where are you rushing off to?

75
07:16.360 --> 07:17.840
Your husband says you massage well.

76
07:19.040 --> 07:22.600
I've been running around pulling strings for you until my whole body aches.

77
07:23.440 --> 07:24.680
Come give me a massage.

78
07:25.760 --> 07:29.640
Go on. Give him a massage. I'm going downstairs to smoke in the lobby.

79
07:31.760 --> 07:32.600
Stay here with me.

80
07:33.880 --> 07:34.920
Why?

81
07:36.040 --> 07:37.240
You don't trust me?

82
07:38.960 --> 07:42.160
No, sir. It's just…

83
07:42.240 --> 07:43.880
I don't think it would be appropriate.

84
07:43.960 --> 07:45.440
You're right.

85
07:46.200 --> 07:47.800
A married woman

86
07:47.880 --> 07:51.520
shouldn't be alone in a room with another man. How about this?

87
07:52.920 --> 07:55.440
Stay here, Big. Don't go anywhere.

88
07:57.000 --> 07:58.000
Yes, sir.

89
07:59.120 --> 08:00.920
Go on. Give him a massage.

90
08:02.200 --> 08:03.320
Go.

91
08:18.440 --> 08:20.240
Right here.

92
08:22.680 --> 08:23.600
Sir.

93
08:24.440 --> 08:27.640
I think I should leave now.

94
08:27.720 --> 08:30.400
Hey. Don't be rude.

95
08:30.480 --> 08:32.640
He went to all this trouble to save us from prison.

96
08:32.720 --> 08:34.960
But he crossed the line first.

97
08:35.039 --> 08:36.520
And how can you be okay with this?

98
08:36.600 --> 08:38.280
He helps us, we help him.

99
08:38.360 --> 08:41.520
Didn't your mother ever teach you to repay a favor?

100
08:41.600 --> 08:45.000
This isn't repaying a favor. This is disgusting.

101
08:45.080 --> 08:48.200
Disgusting or survival. Which one are you choosing?

102
08:48.280 --> 08:51.560
-Move. I'm leaving. -Stop.

103
08:53.320 --> 08:54.480
Big.

104
08:54.560 --> 08:55.880
Stay here!

105
08:55.960 --> 08:57.640
Let me go.

106
08:57.720 --> 09:00.800
Let me go. Somebody help me!

107
09:10.040 --> 09:12.360
Breakfast is ready, Grandpa.

108
09:12.440 --> 09:14.720
Chef Duangjai made it herself.

109
09:17.280 --> 09:18.800
After you eat,

110
09:18.880 --> 09:22.240
drink this herbal medicine. It's good for your bones.

111
09:22.320 --> 09:25.960
I guarantee you won't have aching joints or body pain.

112
09:26.040 --> 09:27.880
I drink it myself,

113
09:27.960 --> 09:30.400
so I can guarantee it works.

114
09:30.480 --> 09:32.920
If it doesn't, I'll give you your money back.

115
09:34.240 --> 09:35.480
Oh.

116
09:35.560 --> 09:36.640
Sorry.

117
09:36.720 --> 09:38.840
Please, go ahead and eat.

118
09:38.920 --> 09:41.440
Come eat with me.

119
09:41.520 --> 09:45.200
That's all right. You eat first. I'll eat in the kitchen later.

120
09:45.840 --> 09:47.400
No.

121
09:48.440 --> 09:50.240
You have to eat here with me.

122
09:50.840 --> 09:52.240
You're serious?

123
09:58.200 --> 10:01.280
Ann, give me a big plate of rice.

124
10:01.360 --> 10:04.160
Of course, Grandma Duangjai.

125
10:09.400 --> 10:11.920
Would you like to go anywhere, sir? I can take you.

126
10:13.600 --> 10:17.640
I just wanted some fresh air. I don't want to go anywhere.

127
10:18.800 --> 10:21.840
By the way, where are Duangjai and Hathaya?

128
10:21.920 --> 10:24.080
They're over there.

129
10:25.080 --> 10:26.640
Planting roses.

130
10:27.320 --> 10:30.800
Grandma, you don't have to do that. There are gardeners here.

131
10:31.840 --> 10:34.880
The gardeners have their own work to do.

132
10:34.960 --> 10:36.640
I want to help.

133
10:37.680 --> 10:39.640
Do you remember what I taught you?

134
10:40.440 --> 10:42.600
If you live under someone else's roof,

135
10:42.680 --> 10:45.680
don't sit around doing nothing.

136
10:46.440 --> 10:48.800
Of course I remember.

137
10:48.880 --> 10:52.200
When you're old, seeing beautiful things

138
10:53.080 --> 10:55.040
brightens your heart.

139
10:55.120 --> 10:57.960
Roses smell nice too.

140
10:58.040 --> 11:02.240
You can put them in a vase for Grandpa. Doesn't that sound good?

141
11:03.000 --> 11:05.840
It does. Then I'll help you.

142
11:05.920 --> 11:07.040
Good.

143
11:13.440 --> 11:14.360
What are you doing?

144
11:15.240 --> 11:16.800
Are you teasing me?

145
11:19.240 --> 11:20.360
Take this.

146
11:20.440 --> 11:22.200
You're washing this shirt for me, Grandma.

147
11:22.280 --> 11:24.080
Why are you like this, Grandma?

148
11:34.160 --> 11:36.640
It's been long since I saw you laugh like this, sir.

149
11:38.960 --> 11:40.200
You're right.

150
11:41.440 --> 11:44.440
I'd almost forgotten what my own laughter sounded like.

151
11:46.040 --> 11:50.680
I think Hathaya and Grandma Duangjai

152
11:50.760 --> 11:54.640
are going to make you happy and keep you laughing every day.

153
11:58.960 --> 12:01.320
Hathaya's life would probably have been more fulfilling

154
12:01.400 --> 12:03.960
and much better if she hadn't had a mother like Hathai.

155
12:23.000 --> 12:24.080
Hey!

156
12:24.160 --> 12:27.600
I checked. Neither of our names is connected to the brothel raid anymore.

157
12:27.680 --> 12:29.600
You did a great job.

158
12:30.200 --> 12:33.200
I found a new location. I've already taken care of the local police.

159
12:33.280 --> 12:36.000
We'll be opening another brothel soon.

160
12:37.320 --> 12:38.680
I'm not doing it anymore.

161
12:39.680 --> 12:42.160
And go find plenty of girls.

162
12:42.240 --> 12:45.200
As many as possible. Students and working women too.

163
12:54.160 --> 12:55.440
Haven't you learned anything?

164
12:56.880 --> 12:58.560
I won't do wrong with you anymore.

165
12:58.640 --> 13:00.520
What's wrong about it?

166
13:00.600 --> 13:03.760
If people want to buy, someone has to sell. We're just the middlemen.

167
13:03.840 --> 13:06.160
That kind of thinking is exactly why

168
13:06.240 --> 13:08.240
you're willing to sell your own wife.

169
13:08.320 --> 13:11.400
A wife isn't something you put on an altar and worship.

170
13:11.480 --> 13:13.840
If you're my wife, you help me make money.

171
13:13.920 --> 13:15.400
You pimp!

172
13:15.480 --> 13:16.600
I'm done.

173
13:16.680 --> 13:18.080
Bitch!

174
13:19.400 --> 13:21.200
You came clinging to me.

175
13:21.280 --> 13:23.360
You hit on me because of my money and car.

176
13:23.440 --> 13:25.120
You've gotten plenty from me.

177
13:25.200 --> 13:27.800
Now it's time for you to pay me back.

178
13:30.520 --> 13:31.800
We're done.

179
13:32.440 --> 13:34.520
Do whatever you want.

180
13:34.600 --> 13:35.560
I'm out.

181
13:35.640 --> 13:36.880
Hey.

182
13:37.520 --> 13:40.440
Remember this.

183
13:40.520 --> 13:42.960
Whether you stay or go, your life depends on me.

184
13:43.040 --> 13:46.160
You've taken plenty from me.

185
13:46.240 --> 13:49.840
Now you'll work to pay me back. And if you try to run,

186
13:49.920 --> 13:51.960
you're dead. Understand?

187
13:55.560 --> 13:57.240
Don't go anywhere.

188
14:11.160 --> 14:12.640
Grandma.

189
14:12.720 --> 14:13.840
What are you doing?

190
14:13.920 --> 14:15.240
Writing down lottery numbers?

191
14:17.640 --> 14:18.880
No.

192
14:18.960 --> 14:20.640
I'm trying to figure out

193
14:20.720 --> 14:23.320
what to cook for your grandpa tomorrow.

194
14:24.000 --> 14:25.960
But I still can't decide.

195
14:26.040 --> 14:29.680
I want to make something special.

196
14:30.800 --> 14:34.280
If you want to impress someone from Bangkok, you'll have to come with me.

197
14:35.120 --> 14:36.880
Where are you taking me?

198
14:36.960 --> 14:40.360
I'm going to show you what people in Bangkok like to eat.

199
14:41.640 --> 14:44.360
Would that be all right? I don't want to impose.

200
14:44.440 --> 14:45.600
What?

201
14:45.680 --> 14:47.240
-Huh? -Let's go.

202
14:48.520 --> 14:51.600
Well, Grandma Duangjai, a lady like you

203
14:51.680 --> 14:54.520
shouldn't be holding onto a man like that. That isn't proper.

204
14:54.600 --> 14:55.680
Oh.

205
14:56.640 --> 14:59.280
Holding a man's arm isn't proper?

206
15:00.600 --> 15:01.640
Then,

207
15:01.720 --> 15:02.880
I'll kiss his cheek.

208
15:04.320 --> 15:05.600
Grandma!

209
15:05.680 --> 15:07.120
Now we've broken every custom.

210
15:07.200 --> 15:09.160
Then what am I supposed to do?

211
15:09.240 --> 15:12.160
Then I have to… kiss you back.

212
15:13.960 --> 15:16.360
And now you have to formally ask for my hand.

213
15:16.960 --> 15:21.480
Oh, no. I don't have any money. You'll just have to take me instead.

214
15:21.560 --> 15:24.040
Oh, you two.

215
15:24.120 --> 15:27.120
Come on.

216
15:27.200 --> 15:29.600
Go ahead and hug. Don't let go of each other.

217
15:34.400 --> 15:37.440
DARA POCHANA

218
15:44.680 --> 15:48.800
The food is good, the atmosphere is nice, and most importantly, the prices are good.

219
15:49.640 --> 15:50.800
Made-to-order stall always have

220
15:50.880 --> 15:52.720
a lot of dishes like this.

221
15:52.800 --> 15:53.960
Grandma,

222
15:54.040 --> 15:57.240
have you figured out what you want to cook for Grandpa tomorrow?

223
15:59.320 --> 16:01.280
Tom yum goong sounds good.

224
16:01.960 --> 16:03.560
So does stir-fried curry paste.

225
16:04.280 --> 16:06.600
And ginger chicken is healthy too.

226
16:06.680 --> 16:09.040
Everything looks good.

227
16:09.120 --> 16:10.360
I can't decide.

228
16:10.440 --> 16:14.600
That's okay. If you can't choose, make all of them.

229
16:14.680 --> 16:18.920
Your cooking is delicious anyway.

230
16:19.880 --> 16:23.280
My granddaughter sure knows how to flatter me.

231
16:32.280 --> 16:33.280
Do you like that?

232
16:34.200 --> 16:35.040
I do.

233
16:46.600 --> 16:47.840
I mean…

234
16:47.920 --> 16:50.400
I like

235
16:50.480 --> 16:53.840
your cooking. You're a great cook.

236
16:53.920 --> 16:55.000
Sure.

237
16:59.080 --> 17:01.520
Let's eat. What should we try first?

238
17:11.560 --> 17:12.480
You first.

239
17:14.079 --> 17:15.119
No, you go ahead.

240
17:15.200 --> 17:17.119
It's fine. You first.

241
17:17.200 --> 17:19.280
I'm not that hungry.

242
17:19.359 --> 17:20.800
Just eat.

243
17:22.240 --> 17:23.680
This one is really good.

244
17:23.760 --> 17:24.720
Then eat it.

245
17:24.800 --> 17:27.000
You're my guest. I have to give you some.

246
17:27.079 --> 17:29.440
It's okay. I can survive.

247
17:33.520 --> 17:36.920
Hathai, I rented a building already.

248
17:37.000 --> 17:38.760
You can start finding women for us.

249
17:45.520 --> 17:46.720
Hathai.

250
17:50.920 --> 17:52.600
Hathai. Where are you going?

251
17:52.680 --> 17:54.640
Don't you run away from me.

252
18:03.120 --> 18:05.120
Excuse me. Stop.

253
18:05.200 --> 18:06.760
Help! Take me to the the alley entrance.

254
18:06.840 --> 18:08.480
Please.

255
18:17.280 --> 18:18.880
Sir.

256
18:19.520 --> 18:22.920
Sir. Please help me.

257
18:24.920 --> 18:26.800
-Big. -I warned you.

258
18:26.880 --> 18:28.760
If you run from me, I'll kill you.

259
18:30.360 --> 18:32.360
Let go!

260
18:36.800 --> 18:37.920
Stop!

261
18:46.480 --> 18:48.560
Was it good, Grandma?

262
18:49.680 --> 18:51.760
I don't even know what to say.

263
18:51.840 --> 18:53.880
I'm so full, it's up to my throat.

264
18:53.960 --> 18:55.800
That full?

265
18:55.880 --> 18:57.520
Come on. Let's head home.

266
18:57.600 --> 19:01.400
Wait. I bought some food for Ann.

267
19:01.480 --> 19:03.720
I left it at the table. I'll go get it.

268
19:03.800 --> 19:06.560
Absolutely not. I'll get it for you.

269
19:07.120 --> 19:08.160
Look after her for me.

270
19:08.760 --> 19:11.080
Sure. But hurry back and take her off my hands.

271
19:11.920 --> 19:13.640
You'd like that, wouldn't you?

272
19:14.440 --> 19:16.240
Just go already.

273
19:21.720 --> 19:24.080
-Mom? -Hathaya, help me.

274
19:28.800 --> 19:30.080
Where have you been?

275
19:30.160 --> 19:32.240
I've been in Bangkok for a while.

276
19:32.320 --> 19:35.120
Mom, turn yourself in. Stop running.

277
19:35.200 --> 19:36.640
You don't have to keep hiding.

278
19:36.720 --> 19:38.560
I'm not running from the police anymore.

279
19:38.640 --> 19:41.560
One of Big's contacts pulled strings and took care of everything.

280
19:41.640 --> 19:43.280
I'm in the clear now.

281
19:44.080 --> 19:45.800
Then who are you running from?

282
19:45.880 --> 19:47.240
Big.

283
19:47.320 --> 19:49.040
He wants to open another brothel,

284
19:49.120 --> 19:52.840
but I'm done. Hathaya, please help me.

285
19:52.920 --> 19:55.360
Let me come live with you. Please.

286
20:00.160 --> 20:02.440
She's taking a long time. I should go check.

287
20:02.520 --> 20:04.520
No, I'll go.

288
20:04.600 --> 20:07.760
I need to use the restroom anyway. You wait here.

289
20:07.840 --> 20:08.920
Are you sure?

290
20:09.000 --> 20:11.640
I can manage. Trust me.

291
20:11.720 --> 20:13.040
I'll only be a minute.

292
20:22.080 --> 20:23.840
I know

293
20:23.920 --> 20:27.200
I've been terrible. I've hurt you.

294
20:27.800 --> 20:29.520
Please give me one more chance.

295
20:29.600 --> 20:33.800
I've learned my lesson. I won't get involved with bad people anymore. Please.

296
20:34.520 --> 20:36.160
I want to help you.

297
20:36.760 --> 20:39.200
But I feel terrible imposing on Grandpa.

298
20:39.840 --> 20:42.920
I know Grandpa doesn't like me.

299
20:43.920 --> 20:46.320
I'll apologize to him.

300
20:46.400 --> 20:50.080
I'll work to make up for everything I've done wrong.

301
20:51.400 --> 20:53.760
I won't ask for anything.

302
20:53.840 --> 20:56.880
If he wants me to be a servant, I'll gladly do it.

303
20:57.480 --> 20:59.920
I just need a roof over my head.

304
21:00.000 --> 21:02.680
Please let me stay with my daughter. Hathaya, please.

305
21:08.520 --> 21:09.800
Hathaya.

306
21:10.880 --> 21:12.840
You don't love me anymore?

307
21:14.280 --> 21:17.600
It's me. I'm your mother.

308
21:17.680 --> 21:20.640
You have to help me. If you don't,

309
21:20.720 --> 21:24.000
Big is going to kill me.

310
21:24.080 --> 21:27.560
Please help me. Please.

311
21:31.400 --> 21:32.800
Please help me.

312
21:35.040 --> 21:35.960
Mom.

313
21:36.480 --> 21:38.680
Hathaya, go wait for me at the car.

314
21:39.360 --> 21:42.400
I need to talk to your mother. Go.

315
21:59.000 --> 22:00.240
Mom.

316
22:07.280 --> 22:09.440
Mom, I'm sorry.

317
22:12.960 --> 22:16.160
I finally understand that Big is terrible.

318
22:16.760 --> 22:18.360
I'm sorry

319
22:19.080 --> 22:22.520
I brought someone like him into our home.

320
22:22.600 --> 22:25.040
He almost killed you.

321
22:25.120 --> 22:27.320
I'm sorry, Mom.

322
22:29.320 --> 22:30.840
What do you want?

323
22:32.160 --> 22:35.080
I want to live with Hathaya.

324
22:35.160 --> 22:36.600
With you.

325
22:37.320 --> 22:39.760
The three of us together.

326
22:40.800 --> 22:42.480
What did Hathaya say?

327
22:43.080 --> 22:44.640
She hasn't said anything.

328
22:46.280 --> 22:48.840
I asked to live at Grandpa's house too.

329
22:49.760 --> 22:52.480
She was almost willing to agree.

330
22:53.240 --> 22:54.680
I'm happy

331
22:54.760 --> 22:56.880
you're living with Hathaya.

332
22:56.960 --> 23:00.120
I want to come back and live with you and my daughter.

333
23:05.720 --> 23:07.080
Mom.

334
23:07.160 --> 23:09.200
Mom? Mom?

335
23:09.280 --> 23:10.360
Mom?

336
23:10.880 --> 23:12.480
Mom, what are you doing?

337
23:12.560 --> 23:14.520
I'm begging you.

338
23:14.600 --> 23:15.600
Mom?

339
23:15.680 --> 23:19.600
Please stop ruining your daughter's life.

340
23:21.840 --> 23:25.400
I know I was wrong.

341
23:26.080 --> 23:27.640
I'm sorry.

342
23:27.720 --> 23:30.600
Please give me one more chance to make things right.

343
23:30.680 --> 23:32.680
Please, Mom.

344
23:33.840 --> 23:34.840
Do you know

345
23:35.640 --> 23:37.160
people in that house

346
23:37.240 --> 23:41.040
think you taught your daughter to be deceitful,

347
23:41.120 --> 23:42.600
to be a bad person?

348
23:43.600 --> 23:46.160
Hathaya had to keep doing good,

349
23:46.240 --> 23:49.520
accept everything they put her through,

350
23:52.080 --> 23:55.560
and prove herself

351
23:56.240 --> 23:57.560
until they finally saw

352
23:57.640 --> 23:59.920
who she truly was.

353
24:01.960 --> 24:03.640
I was shot

354
24:03.720 --> 24:06.080
and almost died.

355
24:06.720 --> 24:08.880
But I survived

356
24:08.960 --> 24:11.440
because of the good Hathaya had done.

357
24:13.760 --> 24:14.880
Now,

358
24:15.560 --> 24:17.520
Grandpa loves her.

359
24:18.400 --> 24:21.760
She has waited her entire life

360
24:22.440 --> 24:25.560
to be welcomed back into his arms.

361
24:26.680 --> 24:29.920
Please don't destroy your daughter's happiness again.

362
24:38.840 --> 24:40.040
Hathai.

363
24:41.920 --> 24:44.080
If you still love me

364
24:44.760 --> 24:47.640
and want to repay me for raising you,

365
24:49.000 --> 24:51.240
then go live your own life.

366
24:52.400 --> 24:55.760
Stop holding Hathaya back.

367
24:57.280 --> 24:58.560
I'm begging you.

368
24:58.640 --> 25:00.040
Mom.

369
25:00.120 --> 25:00.960
Mom.

370
25:01.040 --> 25:04.160
I'm begging you. I truly am.

371
25:04.680 --> 25:06.560
Mom.

372
25:13.480 --> 25:16.520
Mom.

373
25:17.480 --> 25:20.360
I'm begging you.

374
25:24.560 --> 25:25.440
Grandma.

375
25:27.040 --> 25:28.000
Grandma.

376
25:28.080 --> 25:29.560
I feel sorry for Mom.

377
25:29.640 --> 25:31.400
I'll beg Grandpa

378
25:31.480 --> 25:34.000
to let her come stay at the house.

379
25:34.080 --> 25:35.040
Please, Grandma.

380
25:35.720 --> 25:38.160
Where is Mom? Where did she go?

381
25:40.120 --> 25:41.160
Your mom left.

382
25:43.880 --> 25:45.600
Where did she go?

383
26:13.680 --> 26:14.520
Mom.

384
26:16.320 --> 26:19.240
I may have been a terrible mother.

385
26:21.640 --> 26:24.880
But I still have a mother's heart.

386
26:28.600 --> 26:31.120
I'll go my own way.

387
26:33.040 --> 26:34.640
But I want you to know.

388
26:36.240 --> 26:37.640
I admit I was wrong.

389
26:38.440 --> 26:40.840
And I truly regret what I did.

390
26:43.640 --> 26:45.400
Please tell Hathaya,

391
26:47.320 --> 26:50.120
even though I've been a terrible mother,

392
26:50.200 --> 26:52.680
I love my daughter very much.

393
27:21.680 --> 27:23.080
I don't understand.

394
27:23.840 --> 27:26.240
Mom said she wanted to come live with me.

395
27:26.960 --> 27:29.960
Why did she leave?

396
27:31.960 --> 27:33.680
Hathai changed her mind.

397
27:34.280 --> 27:37.280
She feels guilty for causing you problems all these years.

398
27:38.320 --> 27:40.920
She doesn't want to be a burden on you anymore.

399
28:10.400 --> 28:14.000
-Hey. Where did Ann go? -I don't know.

400
28:14.080 --> 28:17.360
How can you not know? I always see you working with her.

401
28:17.440 --> 28:19.240
How can you not know where she is? Wait.

402
28:19.320 --> 28:21.920
Did she sneak out to have fun somewhere?

403
28:22.000 --> 28:22.840
I don't know.

404
28:24.400 --> 28:27.080
Or did she take Hathaya's grandmother out somewhere?

405
28:27.160 --> 28:28.880
-I don't know. -Good grief.

406
28:28.960 --> 28:31.480
Are you a politician? Every question I ask, you don't know.

407
28:31.560 --> 28:32.720
I don't know.

408
28:32.800 --> 28:36.320
Get out of my sight.

409
28:36.400 --> 28:38.560
If I hear you say that one more time,

410
28:38.640 --> 28:40.600
I'll slap you until your brain swells.

411
28:40.680 --> 28:42.120
I don't know.

412
28:44.200 --> 28:45.200
Hey, beautiful.

413
28:46.200 --> 28:47.040
Hey, beautiful.

414
28:47.920 --> 28:49.240
Over here.

415
28:58.640 --> 29:00.120
Were you calling me?

416
29:00.200 --> 29:01.640
Yeah.

417
29:01.720 --> 29:05.120
Do we know each other?

418
29:05.200 --> 29:06.800
Why are you calling me over?

419
29:06.880 --> 29:08.080
I wanted to ask--

420
29:08.160 --> 29:11.520
Ask what? I don't have a boyfriend.

421
29:11.600 --> 29:14.400
I'm completely single. I've been single for a long time too.

422
29:14.480 --> 29:16.360
And if you're going to ask me something,

423
29:16.440 --> 29:20.480
and I can answer, what are you giving me in return?

424
29:20.560 --> 29:23.040
I wanted to ask if Hathai is here.

425
29:24.320 --> 29:26.880
Hathai? Which Hathai?

426
29:26.960 --> 29:29.040
Hathai. She used to be an in-law in this house.

427
29:30.280 --> 29:31.720
That Hathai?

428
29:31.800 --> 29:33.560
She was thrown out ages ago.

429
29:33.640 --> 29:35.920
I know. She told me about it.

430
29:36.000 --> 29:38.080
I'm her husband.

431
29:38.160 --> 29:40.040
Her husband?

432
29:40.120 --> 29:43.760
We had a little argument. She said she was coming back here.

433
29:43.840 --> 29:47.000
She told me her daughter lives in this house.

434
29:47.080 --> 29:48.440
Can I see her daughter?

435
29:48.520 --> 29:51.360
Absolutely not.

436
29:51.440 --> 29:53.840
Now get out. If you don't leave,

437
29:53.920 --> 29:55.800
I'll call the police to haul you off.

438
29:55.880 --> 29:58.000
Fine. I'll go.

439
29:58.080 --> 29:59.560
I'm not scared of you, old hag.

440
29:59.640 --> 30:02.080
Get out. Go.

441
30:03.960 --> 30:06.400
Hathai, you can't hide from me.

442
30:06.480 --> 30:08.760
You're going to work off what you owe me.

443
30:10.040 --> 30:10.880
Huh?

444
30:10.960 --> 30:12.280
-Big. -Old hag!

445
30:12.360 --> 30:15.320
You're still alive? I thought you were dead.

446
30:17.440 --> 30:19.480
Let me go. Let go of me.

447
30:19.560 --> 30:21.400
-Where's your daughter? -I don't know.

448
30:21.480 --> 30:24.480
You came looking for her here. I came looking for her here too.

449
30:24.560 --> 30:26.600
She asked to stay with me.

450
30:26.680 --> 30:29.040
I sent her away. I don't know where she is.

451
30:29.640 --> 30:31.440
-Let me go. -Grandma.

452
30:31.520 --> 30:34.080
I got everything we needed.

453
30:34.160 --> 30:36.800
If I find her anywhere, I'll kill her right there.

454
30:40.680 --> 30:41.960
Grandma, who was that?

455
30:42.040 --> 30:44.560
Nobody. He was just asking for directions.

456
30:44.640 --> 30:45.960
Do you know him?

457
30:46.040 --> 30:47.920
No. Come on.

458
30:48.000 --> 30:49.520
Let's get inside.

459
31:03.800 --> 31:04.960
Grandma.

460
31:05.840 --> 31:09.000
Your beautiful granddaughter is home.

461
31:17.840 --> 31:18.800
Grandma,

462
31:20.400 --> 31:22.320
is something bothering you?

463
31:24.320 --> 31:25.640
No.

464
31:27.400 --> 31:28.480
Grandma,

465
31:29.480 --> 31:31.120
don't lie to me.

466
31:31.800 --> 31:34.800
Aunt Ann said you've barely eaten anything.

467
31:36.240 --> 31:37.800
What's bothering you?

468
31:43.720 --> 31:44.840
Hathaya.

469
31:46.080 --> 31:48.320
I was the one who sent your mom away.

470
31:50.560 --> 31:52.200
Someone like her

471
31:52.280 --> 31:55.440
will probably never truly change.

472
31:56.040 --> 31:57.640
That's why I sent her away.

473
31:58.520 --> 32:01.680
I didn't want her causing you any more problems.

474
32:03.040 --> 32:06.840
But this morning, Big came here.

475
32:07.640 --> 32:09.880
He threatened to kill Hathai.

476
32:13.760 --> 32:16.800
Grandma, I'm worried about Mom.

477
32:17.720 --> 32:19.720
Can we go find her?

478
32:19.800 --> 32:21.880
Then we can bring her back to live with us.

479
32:23.640 --> 32:24.600
Please, Grandma.

480
32:44.920 --> 32:45.840
Help!

481
32:45.920 --> 32:47.600
Mom, help!

482
32:54.920 --> 32:58.000
Stay here!

483
33:06.840 --> 33:09.000
Is this Hathaya?

484
33:09.920 --> 33:12.240
Grandma, Mom sent me a message.

485
33:13.000 --> 33:14.320
What does she want now?

486
33:14.400 --> 33:15.640
I'm calling her back.

487
33:23.240 --> 33:24.520
Hathaya.

488
33:25.680 --> 33:29.800
Mom. It's Hathaya. I'm with Grandma right now.

489
33:30.480 --> 33:32.280
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

490
33:34.280 --> 33:36.160
I've been a terrible mother.

491
33:38.680 --> 33:40.160
Ever since you were born,

492
33:41.000 --> 33:43.560
I've never done anything to make you proud.

493
33:45.960 --> 33:50.280
I kept trying to make our lives comfortable.

494
33:50.360 --> 33:53.240
I kept trying to make up for my mistakes.

495
33:55.000 --> 33:58.120
But the more I tried, the more I ruined everything.

496
34:01.040 --> 34:03.720
I have no excuses.

497
34:06.320 --> 34:08.400
My life is worthless.

498
34:10.199 --> 34:11.920
Even you grandmother,

499
34:12.000 --> 34:14.159
my own mother,

500
34:14.960 --> 34:17.960
rejected me.

501
34:18.639 --> 34:19.719
Hathai.

502
34:20.400 --> 34:23.960
We need to talk. Where are you?

503
34:25.239 --> 34:26.600
Mom.

504
34:29.600 --> 34:30.960
Mom.

505
34:34.000 --> 34:35.800
I admit it.

506
34:36.880 --> 34:39.080
I used to resent you

507
34:39.159 --> 34:41.800
for making me grow up poor.

508
34:43.360 --> 34:46.360
I wanted a better life.

509
34:46.440 --> 34:48.639
A comfortable life.

510
34:51.520 --> 34:53.360
But I was blind.

511
34:54.120 --> 34:56.760
I became obsessed with wealth.

512
34:56.840 --> 34:59.800
I couldn't see your love or everything

513
34:59.880 --> 35:02.000
you sacrificed for me.

514
35:02.080 --> 35:03.760
I'm sorry.

515
35:07.520 --> 35:09.680
I'm sorry.

516
35:12.400 --> 35:14.880
Mom, where are you?

517
35:14.960 --> 35:16.840
Grandma and I will come get you.

518
35:17.680 --> 35:19.160
Hathaya,

519
35:20.120 --> 35:23.680
don't let me become another burden on you.

520
35:24.920 --> 35:26.800
I called to say goodbye.

521
35:28.000 --> 35:31.080
Hathai. Listen to me first.

522
35:32.320 --> 35:33.400
Mom,

523
35:34.440 --> 35:37.080
please forgive me for everything.

524
35:41.560 --> 35:44.120
If there really is a next life,

525
35:46.560 --> 35:47.480
I…

526
35:50.560 --> 35:51.480
I…

527
35:52.400 --> 35:55.920
want to be born again so I can make up for everything I did wrong.

528
35:58.000 --> 36:00.880
I'll be a good daughter to you

529
36:01.760 --> 36:04.760
and a good mother to my child.

530
36:06.080 --> 36:08.280
Goodbye, Mom.

531
36:08.360 --> 36:10.840
Mom. Don't.

532
36:10.920 --> 36:12.760
Don't do anything drastic.

533
36:12.840 --> 36:15.360
Please don't hurt yourself.

534
36:17.200 --> 36:20.360
Hathai. Listen to me.

535
36:33.800 --> 36:36.360
-Hathai. -Mom.

536
36:36.440 --> 36:37.920
Mom.

537
36:47.520 --> 36:48.880
-Mom. -Hathai.

538
36:51.400 --> 36:52.440
Mom.

539
36:57.800 --> 36:59.240
Mom.

540
37:01.320 --> 37:03.680
Mom. I love you.

541
37:03.760 --> 37:05.520
Please be okay.

542
37:05.600 --> 37:08.200
Come back and live with me.

543
37:08.840 --> 37:10.640
I love you.

544
37:10.720 --> 37:12.840
I forgive you.

545
37:13.920 --> 37:15.840
You don't have to wait until your next life.

546
37:17.520 --> 37:20.440
You have to stay alive and make things right in this one.

547
37:21.080 --> 37:25.000
You have to stay and take care of me until the day I die.

548
37:39.360 --> 37:43.120
Mom, are you listening to me?

549
37:43.200 --> 37:44.280
Hello?

550
37:44.360 --> 37:45.760
Hathai.

551
37:45.840 --> 37:48.360
You have to keep fighting.

552
37:50.280 --> 37:53.400
I'll live. I'll fight.

553
37:55.720 --> 37:57.840
I'll stay alive. I'll fight, sweetheart.

554
38:05.800 --> 38:07.760
I'll go back and start over.

555
38:07.840 --> 38:10.480
I'm going to make things right.

556
38:34.000 --> 38:36.600
Grandma, Mom sent her location.

557
38:36.680 --> 38:40.240
We'll go get her. I'll have Ramil drive us.

558
38:59.360 --> 39:02.240
Mom sent this location. She must be somewhere around here.

559
39:02.960 --> 39:05.000
Let's split up and look. I'll go that way.

560
39:05.080 --> 39:06.200
Yes.

561
39:06.280 --> 39:08.520
Grandma, let's go find Mom.

562
39:15.160 --> 39:19.280
Mom. Grandma and I are here. Where are you?

563
39:21.120 --> 39:23.680
Mom? Where are you?

564
39:30.640 --> 39:32.040
Hathaya?

565
39:34.480 --> 39:35.200
Big.

566
39:35.280 --> 39:37.600
Let me go. Let me go right now.

567
39:37.680 --> 39:39.680
I told you I'm done.

568
39:39.760 --> 39:41.200
Let me go.

569
39:41.280 --> 39:44.440
I told you already. You can't escape me.

570
39:44.520 --> 39:48.800
You know all my secrets. If you betray me, I'll get arrested.

571
39:48.880 --> 39:51.200
I'll swear on anything you want.

572
39:51.280 --> 39:54.480
I'll never get involved. Just let me go. We'll go our separate ways.

573
39:54.560 --> 39:56.320
Stop. Stop!

574
39:56.400 --> 39:57.720
Don't hurt my mom.

575
39:57.800 --> 39:59.920
Hathaya, help me.

576
40:00.000 --> 40:02.480
Let go of my daughter. Let her go right now.

577
40:02.560 --> 40:04.200
-At first… -Grandma, don't.

578
40:04.280 --> 40:07.200
I only wanted revenge on your daughter for trying to leave me.

579
40:07.280 --> 40:09.720
But then I saw the house you people live in.

580
40:09.800 --> 40:11.320
I changed my mind.

581
40:11.400 --> 40:14.120
Go get me ten million baht,

582
40:14.200 --> 40:15.800
then I'll let her go.

583
40:16.480 --> 40:19.680
I only work there. I don't have that kind of money.

584
40:19.760 --> 40:21.880
Then find it. Or she dies.

585
40:21.960 --> 40:24.320
Please don't hurt my mother.

586
40:24.400 --> 40:25.880
I'm begging you.

587
40:25.960 --> 40:27.560
Steal if you have to. I don't care.

588
40:27.640 --> 40:29.360
Bring me ten million tonight.

589
40:29.440 --> 40:32.080
Otherwise, you can come collect your mother's body.

590
40:32.160 --> 40:35.880
Okay. Okay. Just don't hurt her.

591
40:35.960 --> 40:40.680
Please. I only have a few million available right now.

592
40:40.760 --> 40:43.680
Let my mom go,

593
40:43.760 --> 40:47.120
and I'll get you the rest.

594
40:47.200 --> 40:49.680
Fine. Then transfer everything you have to me.

595
40:49.760 --> 40:51.520
What's your account number?

596
40:52.120 --> 40:53.280
Hathaya.

597
40:56.280 --> 40:57.240
Let me go!

598
40:57.320 --> 40:59.080
-Run. Hathaya, run. -Grandma!

599
40:59.160 --> 41:01.000
Mom, go! Quickly!

600
41:01.080 --> 41:02.440
Careful, Mom.

601
41:06.800 --> 41:08.680
-Come on. -Walk carefully.

602
41:08.760 --> 41:10.400
Walk carefully.

603
41:12.560 --> 41:13.920
-Big. -Hathai.

604
41:14.000 --> 41:15.680
No!

605
41:15.760 --> 41:18.080
-Mom. -Grandma.

606
41:18.160 --> 41:21.400
You try to outsmart me, your whole damn family dies.

607
41:22.520 --> 41:23.440
Grandma.

608
41:23.520 --> 41:25.400
-Mom. -Grandma.

609
41:26.280 --> 41:28.760
-Mom. -Grandma.

610
41:31.800 --> 41:33.840
You haven't seen the last of me.

611
41:35.200 --> 41:36.280
Mom.

612
41:36.880 --> 41:40.040
-Mom. -Grandma.

613
41:40.120 --> 41:42.120
-Grandma. -Mom.

614
41:42.200 --> 41:44.000
Please be okay.

615
41:44.080 --> 41:46.200
I'm taking you to the hospital.

616
41:47.000 --> 41:49.760
-I need an ambulance immediately. -You'll be fine, Mom.

617
41:51.600 --> 41:53.760
There's no need, sweetheart.

618
41:54.680 --> 41:57.440
This is as far as my merit can take me.

619
41:59.360 --> 42:00.400
No, Mom.

620
42:01.280 --> 42:02.240
Mom.

621
42:03.120 --> 42:05.600
You're too tough to die.

622
42:05.680 --> 42:07.480
You survived once already.

623
42:07.560 --> 42:09.560
You have to stay with me.

624
42:13.600 --> 42:17.200
I traded my merit for your life.

625
42:19.280 --> 42:21.680
No, Mom.

626
42:21.760 --> 42:24.120
Don't blame yourself.

627
42:25.520 --> 42:27.720
You told me

628
42:27.800 --> 42:29.800
you were going to become a new person.

629
42:30.880 --> 42:32.560
You can do it.

630
42:33.680 --> 42:35.680
You have to be strong.

631
42:38.520 --> 42:41.880
I'm sorry I rejected you

632
42:41.960 --> 42:43.960
and drove you away before.

633
42:45.720 --> 42:48.400
But I'm glad

634
42:49.200 --> 42:52.160
I had the chance to make it right.

635
42:52.840 --> 42:55.600
-Mom. -Grandma.

636
42:56.400 --> 42:59.560
You don't have to wait until your next life.

637
43:00.600 --> 43:01.720
You can still

638
43:02.440 --> 43:06.200
be a good mother in this one.

639
43:08.840 --> 43:10.800
Take care

640
43:10.880 --> 43:12.160
of Hathaya for me.

641
43:12.240 --> 43:13.480
Grandma.

642
43:15.600 --> 43:18.600
I promise, Mom. I promise.

643
43:19.920 --> 43:22.280
I'll take good care of my daughter.

644
43:23.400 --> 43:25.920
I'll give my life for her,

645
43:26.000 --> 43:28.480
just like you did for me.

646
43:32.360 --> 43:33.600
Grandma.

647
43:37.920 --> 43:39.880
When I'm gone,

648
43:40.560 --> 43:43.440
you have to take good care of yourself.

649
43:43.520 --> 43:45.720
No.

650
43:45.800 --> 43:48.040
Nothing is going to happen to you.

651
43:48.120 --> 43:51.360
The three of us are supposed to finally be together.

652
43:51.440 --> 43:53.520
Don't talk like this.

653
43:55.600 --> 43:58.520
Your mom is back with you now.

654
43:59.240 --> 44:02.280
You won't be alone anymore.

655
44:05.680 --> 44:07.840
You…

656
44:07.920 --> 44:11.080
take good care of Grandpa.

657
44:12.920 --> 44:15.600
Pay attention to him.

658
44:16.960 --> 44:19.160
Old people

659
44:19.960 --> 44:22.080
may sometimes have sharp tongues,

660
44:23.720 --> 44:25.200
but our hearts

661
44:25.800 --> 44:27.680
are fragile.

662
44:28.960 --> 44:31.200
Look after him carefully, sweetheart.

663
44:32.640 --> 44:34.840
I'm asking you.

664
44:36.720 --> 44:37.680
Grandma…

665
44:39.640 --> 44:41.680
Grandma…

666
44:46.160 --> 44:50.400
I finally figured out what I wanted to cook for Grandpa.

667
44:52.520 --> 44:55.960
Make it for him for me.

668
44:56.040 --> 44:57.680
No. No.

669
44:57.760 --> 45:01.080
I'm not accepting this. I won't do it for you.

670
45:01.160 --> 45:03.800
Grandpa is going to eat your cooking.

671
45:04.640 --> 45:07.880
You have to make it for him yourself.

672
45:09.360 --> 45:11.160
Grandma.

673
45:16.360 --> 45:19.080
I've been so happy

674
45:20.000 --> 45:22.640
to have had the chance to take care of you.

675
45:26.400 --> 45:27.960
Grandma.

676
45:28.040 --> 45:31.560
Remember what I taught you.

677
45:33.240 --> 45:36.440
We can't choose how we're born.

678
45:38.040 --> 45:41.360
But we can choose

679
45:42.240 --> 45:44.440
to be good people.

680
45:48.680 --> 45:50.880
-Mom. Mom! -Grandma.

681
45:51.840 --> 45:54.080
-Mom. -Grandma.

682
45:54.160 --> 45:56.160
Grandma, please!

683
46:04.440 --> 46:06.680
-Grandma! -Mom!

684
46:07.520 --> 46:09.680
-Grandma! -Mom!

685
46:17.640 --> 46:18.880
Grandma!

686
46:43.200 --> 46:44.560
Hello, sir.

687
46:45.800 --> 46:48.560
Ramil, where does the case stand?

688
46:49.160 --> 46:51.440
Big is facing very serious charges.

689
46:51.520 --> 46:55.280
The lawyer said he'll likely receive the maximum sentence.

690
46:55.960 --> 46:58.240
The world is driven by karma.

691
46:58.840 --> 47:00.960
All beings must live according to their karma.

692
47:01.920 --> 47:05.280
Whatever karma someone creates, they must eventually face consequences.

693
47:07.040 --> 47:08.840
How is Hathaya?

694
47:45.840 --> 47:47.680
I'm not going to tell you not to cry.

695
47:53.080 --> 47:54.840
I want you to stay

696
47:56.360 --> 47:58.520
with your memories of Grandma Duangjai.

697
48:01.080 --> 48:02.800
And I want you

698
48:04.880 --> 48:06.600
to let all of your grief out.

699
48:14.480 --> 48:17.240
Right now, you probably feel like your whole world

700
48:18.440 --> 48:19.440
has collapsed.

701
48:22.440 --> 48:24.640
It was like that for me

702
48:26.720 --> 48:28.440
when my father left me

703
48:30.360 --> 48:32.200
and my mother started a new family.

704
48:34.400 --> 48:36.360
I felt

705
48:37.760 --> 48:41.040
completely alone. Like I had nothing left.

706
48:58.000 --> 49:00.240
It's Hathai. Hathaya's mother.

707
49:00.320 --> 49:01.960
She's already come into the house.

708
49:02.040 --> 49:03.640
Then what do you want me to do?

709
49:03.720 --> 49:05.280
Kneel and bow to me.

710
49:05.360 --> 49:08.760
NEXT EPISODE

711
49:08.840 --> 49:10.040
What are you doing?

712
49:11.240 --> 49:13.600
If you like things spicy,

713
49:13.680 --> 49:16.880
then I'll pour some curry and make it really burn.

714
49:20.040 --> 49:22.440
-Chayanee. -Don't raise your voice at me.

715
49:22.520 --> 49:24.680
Did Chayanee say something that upset you?

716
51:22.480 --> 51:24.400
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
